%% M² sequence: one spoken turn
sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant R as Renderer
  participant M as Main process
  participant G as Groq API
  U->>R: Speak (mic open while Talk is on)
  R->>R: Voice activity detects end of speech
  R->>M: m2:transcribe (audio)
  M->>G: Speech to text
  G-->>M: Transcript
  M-->>R: Transcript
  R->>R: Match command, else build prompt (few numbers, label, recent turns)
  R->>M: m2:chat (messages)
  M->>G: Chat completion
  G-->>M: Reply text
  M-->>R: Reply
  R->>M: m2:tts (text)
  M->>G: Text to speech
  G-->>M: Voice audio
  M-->>R: Audio
  R-->>U: Plays voice, shows words and orb
